cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the article below.
title: "The Entropy Bridge: From Mechanistic Interpretability to Explainability in Capsule Networks"
abstract: >-
  Implementation, canonical result artifacts and reproduction pipeline for a study
  of Capsule Networks through causal mechanistic interpretability. Exhaustive
  single-capsule ablation reveals a functional hierarchy among primary capsules
  (the Hub-Specialist taxonomy), which motivates Vectorized Entropy Gating (VEG),
  a routing rule that learns a per-capsule uncertainty tolerance.
